this place possible?

77
00:03:55,110 --> 00:03:57,696
Which brings me back to the part
where you get everyone killed.

78
00:03:57,780 --> 00:04:00,574
Nah.
Not if we do it right.

79
00:04:00,658 --> 00:04:02,618
Oh. Okay.

80
