But look at it
from where I'm standing.

85
00:04:23,931 --> 00:04:27,935
You want me to help plan
a suicide mission

86
00:04:28,018 --> 00:04:31,522
because of some things that you
saw in a mushroom trip!

87
00:04:31,605 --> 00:04:33,023
What do I have to do,

88
00:04:33,107 --> 00:04:35,985
what do I have to do to prove
to you this is real?

89
00:04:36,068 --> 00:04:37,486
Yeah, I don't know.

90
00:04:39,488 --> 00:04:42,282
- The door.
- What?

91
00:04:42,366 --> 00:04:45,327
You and I went into the basement
in Colony House.

92
00:04:45,411 --> 00:04:47,079
I already told you,
we didn't go anywhere.

93
00:04:47,162 --> 00:04:49,540
Yeah, that's right,
we didn't.

94
00:04:49,623 --> 00:04:51,583
And I've never been inside
the basement at Colony House

95
00:04:51,667 --> 00:04:53,002
so I would have no way
of knowing

96
00:04:53,085 --> 00:04:54,378
what it looks like
down there.

97
00:04:54,461 --> 00:04:57,089
Jade, describing the basement
of Colony House

98
