108
00:05:29,329 --> 00:05:31,790
Come on.
Here you go. All right.

109
00:05:31,874 --> 00:05:34,251
Explain to me why this was fun
for your generation?

110
00:05:34,334 --> 00:05:36,712
- We didn't have phones.
- Interesting.

111
00:05:36,795 --> 00:05:38,922
It's like social media
from the Stone Age.

112
00:05:39,006 --> 00:05:42,217
This is it! This, this is
the basement I saw.

113
00:05:42,301 --> 00:05:43,552
It's a little
more organized.

114
00:05:43,635 --> 00:05:45,763
Yeah, we're trying
to build a narrative

115
00:05:45,846 --> 00:05:47,306
for the people
that came before us.

116
00:05:47,389 --> 00:05:48,515
See if we missed anything--

117
00:05:48,599 --> 00:05:50,059
Boyd's just trying
to keep me busy

118
00:05:50,142 --> 00:05:51,935
because he knows that I want
to kill myself.

119
00:05:52,019 --> 00:05:53,729
Oh.
How's that going?

120
00:05:53,812 --> 00:05:55,230
I haven't slit
my wrists yet.

121
00:05:55,314 --> 00:05:56,607
So it's going well
then.

122
00:05:56,690 --> 00:05:58,108
What do you need?

123
00:05:58,192 --> 00:06:00,027
I'm looking for a secret door
that I saw

124
00:06:00,110 --> 00:06:02,029
while I was on mushrooms
I found in the forest.

125
00:06:03,781 --> 00:06:05,157
People have strange
conversations here.

126
00:06:09,953 --> 00:06:11,455
Yahtzee!

127
00:06:19,254 --> 00:06:20,964
Come on!
Gimme a hand!

128
