160
00:08:59,039 --> 00:09:02,960
Maybe the door-- Maybe...
maybe it's just a metaphor.

161
00:09:04,169 --> 00:09:06,046
Maybe the bones
were a metaphor.

162
00:09:06,129 --> 00:09:10,759
No! No! Listen. Look.

163
00:09:10,842 --> 00:09:12,386
