is that true?

791
00:48:04,340 --> 00:48:06,134
I think
it might be, yeah.

792
00:48:06,217 --> 00:48:08,928
"Tip of the spear."

793
00:48:09,012 --> 00:48:10,263
What's that?

794
00:48:11,848 --> 00:48:13,266
This guy named Martin
once told me

795
00:48:13,349 --> 00:48:14,892
that those things
that come at night,

796
00:48:14,976 --> 00:48:16,394
they're just the tip
of the spear.

797
00:48:18,396 --> 00:48:19,772
The bones of those kids,
are they down there?

798
00:48:19,856 --> 00:48:21,524
- Are they in the tunnels?
- I don't know.

799
00:48:21,608 --> 00:48:23,192
What the fuck do you know?!

800
