807
00:49:28,216 --> 00:49:30,635
You wanna fuck with me?
Huh?

808
00:49:40,144 --> 00:49:42,397
You wanna test me, huh?

809
00:49:47,318 --> 00:49:49,696
What the hell?

810
00:49:53,408 --> 00:49:55,159
You wanna fuck with me?

811
00:49:59,831 --> 00:50:02,709
You want me to go down
